From: SONiC-VPP maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] acl: enforce masked outer VLAN ID on ingress and egress

Keep the fixed 48-byte tuple ABI and validate VLAN qualifiers in the
complete hash collision and linear matchers. Recover membership across
L2 tag rewrites, including untagged PVIDs, QinQ and routed subinterfaces.
Reject reflection with VLAN-qualified policies because session keys do
not include VLAN metadata; never let an older session bypass such a policy.

